  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've noticed something when I was using a custom safety setting, when I set it to render everything except particles on users, I noticed I was still able to see the particles from their avatar if they activated them through a custom override such as a hand gesture or an emote. I only yesterday realized I should probably make a Canny post about this when I mentioned it to a friend. If you opted out to see particles through your safety settings but still see them through an animation, I assume it could be a giant issue due to possible exploits with having an animation always play so it'd ignore such settings. Thanks for reading this.",
